<title>USA: United Dominion buys Dominion Building.</title>
<headline>United Dominion buys Dominion Building.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Industries Ltd said Friday that its Ceco Door Products unit has acquired Dominion Building Products, a privately held manufacturer of ready-to-install steel doors, frames and pre-hung windows for metal buildings.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;Pre-hung metal doors are gaining broad market acceptance and these added value services are important to our customers,&quot; said Richard Bradbury, president of Ceco.</p>
</text>
